"""tpw: map third-party writing about a set of orgs/channels/people from seed links.

Seeds (channels, sites, brain pages, local brain folders) -> LLM entity + query plan -> news
discovery (Google News RSS with adaptive date windows, Bing News RSS, GDELT, Wikipedia citations)
-> LLM triage -> fetch + extract -> LLM per-article analysis (stance, topics, people, claims,
connections) -> LLM synthesis (stories, topic narratives, common threads, brain links)
-> navigable markdown wiki (index with aggregates, articles, outlets, topics, stories, people,
connections, timeline, datasets).

See ~/.agents/skills/third-party-writing/SKILL.md.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

